{%- comment -%}
  pdp-construction-slot.liquid — R-07 module 9, construction-detail imagery.

  🚫 GATED on A-026 (physical sample verification). This is an ABSENT SLOT, not a
  placeholder and not an empty box: it renders whatever is in
  product.metafields.custom.construction_imagery (a list of images) and nothing
  when that is empty. Populatable by a content change alone — no template edit —
  the moment the Hub clears A-026. Until then the metafield stays unset and this
  module renders nothing.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign shots = product.metafields.custom.construction_imagery.value -%}
{%- if shots != blank -%}
  <div class="sayoji-construction">
    {%- for shot in shots -%}
      <figure class="sayoji-construction__item">
        {{ shot | image_url: width: 900 | image_tag: loading: 'lazy', widths: '400,600,900', alt: shot.alt | escape }}
      </figure>
    {%- endfor -%}
  </div>
{%- endif -%}
